# Lean repo: keep what rebuilds the book (text, prompts, logs, scripts, fonts,
# finished art). Raw generations, unfaded backgrounds and build output stay on
# disk only (back them up elsewhere).
build/
*/art/raw/
*/art/bg/
*/art/drafts/
*/art/hand/
*/art/style-tests/*.png
!*/art/style-tests/B-bold-cartoon.png
*/art/icon-test/
*/art/mascot/raw/
*/art/openers/raw/*
!*/art/openers/raw/r01-linocut.png
*/art/librarian/raw/
*/art/extras/raw/*
!*/art/extras/raw/J1-lib.png
*/art/extras/flip-src/
*/art/extras/flipbook-preview.gif
*/art/contact-*.png
*/listing/pages/
*/listing/a*.png
scripts/tools/*.png
_series/mascot/raw/*
!_series/mascot/raw/model-*.png
.DS_Store
# Superseded raws and ChatGPT redraw downloads (raws stay local, like */art/raw/)
*/art/raw-replaced/
*/art/*/raw-replaced/
*/art/bg-replaced/
*/art/regen-*/*.png
